    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n89911" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προσπαρ-ίσταμαι</span></b> , 
			Med.
		, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bring to one's
				side, subdue besides</i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				50.12
			</span></i> (nisi leg. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">προπ-</span>).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>put in one's mind, excite besides</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τόλμαν τινί</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					J.
					<u>AJ</u>
					19.1.10
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> intr.,
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τροσπαρέστη τινὶ νομίζειν</span>
			<i>it came into</i> his <i>mind</i>, prob. in <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				102.9
			</span></i>.</div>
